Package: telcosec-cli
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Provides: telcochisel
Description: Unified Telecom Security Operator CLI and diagnostics suite
 The telcosec command center is a zero-dependency static operator CLI
 for telecommunications security research, baseband analysis, and Software
 Defined Radio (SDR) hardware diagnostics.
 .
  Key features:
   * Kernel real-time latency and PAM limits telemetry
   * High-throughput USBFS buffer management for continuous MSPS SDRs
   * 10GbE network optimization (MTU 9000, 4096 ring descriptors, 64MB socket buffers)
   * Open5GS 5G Standalone core lifecycle and subscriber provisioning
   * Modular 10-tier Debian metapackage suite management (telcosec pkg)
   * Pure Go ISO/IEC 7816-3 ATR smartcard decoder and eSIM LPA inspection (telcosec sim)
   * Embedded shell autocompletion for Bash, Zsh, and Fish
   * Offline telecom tools catalog search across 88 security suites
